00:02:11.765 --> 00:02:15.335 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 "Mais on a peur

00:02:12.966 --> 00:02:16.570 size:53% position:73% line:53%
jeune femme, nous sommes

00:02:14.201 --> 00:02:17.804 size:53% position:73% line:53%
