00:02:17.905 --> 00:02:21.475 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Un jeu ouououououououout.

00:02:19.106 --> 00:02:22.709 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Car c'est la deuxième fois

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:23.944 size:53% position:73% line:53%
